应用介绍：
校体云（青少年体质健康管理系统）——为中小学生提供体质健康的监测、检测、采集、数据分析、数据平台、运动处方、体育课改等一系列学校体育信息化与学生体质健康整体解决方案。

【产品特点】
@提升学生体质健康，专家团队专业分析
@体测体质 语系转换丨发现孩子体质弱项，针对性改善
@定制化 改善方案丨让每个学生都有自己的运动“私教”
@个性化 健康食谱丨绘制孩子专属生长曲线，专业有营养
@AI科技 体感运动丨 精准动作识别 实时智能纠错

一句话简介：校体云----青少年体质健康管理系统

** OVER 550 SCHOOLS in Hong Kong, Taiwan and Mainland China are using EduVenture now (Jan 2021)

** OVER 70,000 students have used EduVenture in their outdoor learning activities (Jan 2021)

** MORE THAN 1000 TEACHERS have attended professional training courses learning how to combine EduVenture into their teaching **

Features highlights:
- Comprehensive GPS assisted learning and teaching;
- Ready to go inquiry-based and student-centred learning; 
- Support different zoom levels and multi-layer maps.
- Multi-media questions and answers;
- Realtime multiplayer learning environment (Internet connection required);
- No more "pre-trip" required; Field trip preparation is Do-Online-Now (DON); 
- Easy and smart answer viewing for post-activity evaluation. 
- Multi-language support.

What is EduVenture?

EduVenture is an integrated GPS-location based learning system intends​ to facilitate outdoor learning and teaching. EduVenture X is the Apps being used in the process of outdoor learning. 


How to Use EduVenture?

Teachers create and modify outdoor learning materials with the EduVenture Composers (Web-based tool) before an outdoor learning activity begins. Students then experience self-directed outdoor-based learning with such learning materials. Both teacher and students can review the whole outdoor learning process through accessing to the EduVenture Retriever.
